<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Contact},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">We have good news regarding your modification request due to COVID-19. We were able to resubmit your modification request and have received the following approval:</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial">We</font><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;have received approval to stop the payments through . Payments are due to resume 4/16.&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We wish you and
your family the best during this difficult time. Visit our site for updates and
support for our customers:&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;">{!Case.Email_Website_Address__c}</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="MsoHyperlink">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="MsoHyperlink"><b>We
also encourage you to reach out to your banking partner for immediate
assistance</b></span><span class="MsoHyperlink"> with loans administered by the SBA.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal">















</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Loan Modification Team</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: medium;">9820 Towne Centre Drive</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">San Diego, CA 92121</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
